  "details": "1. Join to the same instance as other users.\n\n2. View profiles of other users in the same instance.\n\n3. BIO is displayed, but \"NOTE\" is not. \n\nIt is necessary to join without seeing other users' profiles.\n\nExample :\n\n- Other user joins my instance.\n\n- Join from the world info screen.\n\n- Receive an invite.\n\n\"NOTE\" of users in other instances or offline users will be displayed.",
